# Ep6 — model switching in Claude Code (REAL product)
Output channels/claude-tricks/assets/ep06/term_model.mp4
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1350
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type "cd ~/demo-project && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "claude"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "/model"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 4s
